| token             | range                | notes                                                                                        |
| ----------------- | -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| BEATS spacing     | 1.2–1.8s             | <0.8s frantic, >2.5s loses the pulse; keep spacing even — it's a beat                        |
